444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 239 0 R
/E (TheHand2Hand project connects customers with local laborers through a simple and reliable digitalplatform built using the MERN stack \(MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js\). It provides key features such as user registration, worker profiles portfolio building , job posting , Booking system,chat system within the application,ratings & reviews , search and filters and service management through an interactive React-based interface. The backend efficiently handles data using Node.js, Express, and MongoDB Atlas, with JWT-based authentication ensuring security. The platform is deployed online with   the backend on Render and created an APK file for frontend, providing a scalable cloud-based solution. With additional improvements and future enhancements, Hand2Hand aims to further simplify service access, support local workers, and promote community development through technology.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
